{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F1Pbma5oVDyeKaixnjruAR","type":"tool_result","content":"80408b4c72ef08be3ec628d578f8b008644c1c7e447a4cc8c5979b08212e78aa  pixel-engine.js\n# Changelog\n\nWhat changed in Pixel Engine for a game built on it, newest first. The version is\n`package.json`'s; a game reads it as `ENGINE_VERSION`, `Engine.version` or\n`engine.state().version`. The engine kit (`npm run bundle`, docs/GUIDE.md) ships this file.\n 60159 GUIDE.md\n 15883 ASSETS.md\n248164 API.md\n176448 LIBRARY.md\n 17587 vendor/hub/README.md\n518241 total\nexamples:\nlooks.html\nlooks.js\nmarket-models.js\nmarket.html\nmarket.js\nside-scroller.html\nside-scroller.js\ntop-down.html\ntop-down.js\n\npacks:\nindex.json\nkenney-castle.json\nkenney-furniture.json\nkenney-mini-dungeon.json\nkenney-nature.json\nkenney-tiny-dungeon.json\nkenney-tiny-town.json","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d022da92-c114-4f47-a8f5-ca68c59e3f52","uuid":"98c092b3-dedf-4b43-a538-9c98a3b48aab","timestamp":"2026-11-05T08:22:12.397Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"80408b4c72ef08be3ec628d578f8b008644c1c7e447a4cc8c5979b08212e78aa  pixel-engine.js\n# Changelog\n\nWhat changed in Pixel Engine for a game built on it, newest first. The version is\n`package.json`'s; a game reads it as `ENGINE_VERSION`, `Engine.version` or\n`engine.state().version`. The engine kit (`npm run bundle`, docs/GUIDE.md) ships this file.\n 60159 GUIDE.md\n 15883 ASSETS.md\n248164 API.md\n176448 LIBRARY.md\n 17587 vendor/hub/README.md\n518241 total\nexamples:\nlooks.html\nlooks.js\nmarket-models.js\nmarket.html\nmarket.js\nside-scroller.html\nside-scroller.js\ntop-down.html\ntop-down.js\n\npacks:\nindex.json\nkenney-castle.json\nkenney-furniture.json\nkenney-mini-dungeon.json\nkenney-nature.json\nkenney-tiny-dungeon.json\nkenney-tiny-town.json","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01F1Pbma5oVDyeKaixnjruAR