{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjaGP6noPfzL5Rfxydsm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The optional dressing is now in, and the full suite passes again (1137/1137) on the rebuilt game. The deliverables in the root are refreshed: `WhyFit-WiiFit-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261105-012138.html` and `exit-interview.json`, which still parses as JSON.\n\nWhat I added this pass:\n- **Sunbeams:** thin light shafts in the class backdrop.\n- **Plumb bob:** a bob on a spring chain hanging from Coach's wrist.\n- **Camera push-in:** during Holding Still the view zooms a little once you've been steady for a few seconds.\n- **Footprint decals:** footprints appear on the floor as you step in Step Class.\n- **Splash ripples:** a ripple ring spreads from the Pier Jump splash.\n\nI only looked at a screenshot of Holding Still. That showed the push-in and the sunbeams working. The plumb bob is out of frame there, and I did not check the footprints or the pier ripples visually. The test suite does run both activities without errors.\n\nA first attempt at the push-in left the scene blank. I had overwritten a scene method named `push`, and I renamed my variable. A second break (the new beams crashing the Long Stand scene) was caught by the playthrough test and fixed before the final run.\n\nI did not re-audit the rest of PLAN.md item by item beyond what the tests and screenshots cover. The previously judged screens (title, results, podium, jog HUD) were fixed as noted earlier."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":334,"cache_read_input_tokens":655950,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":334},"output_tokens":497,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"